71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_QJfyJM3tYMQ7kNvwGHAhvi&_nc_oc=AdqS8JfHQNej-c-N50LQ6hUWEaUJ9HSa2sZYAosEz-ni99YposrzujErGEs5-hVPwvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8P8t26fBWnfhBfUkx5EbW_CPDHnxD-y69OQfblcxrm4g&oe=6A3BD739"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dVMMeozSUh0Q7kNvwHZCUH7&_nc_oc=AdrvmE_2AIEfYT13I7lyRP9WNzxJTGZMsFxWAW7UcBw9Af5Ce6O0zqqOGNIkOGlRMg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-6_XA7XtWPYIjkhV7lvrqbRnHhryoGeLRFDipAu6RW-Q&oe=6A3BEA13"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kBtXR_ij4_4Q7kNvwH2i7wd&_nc_oc=AdpTXkfh9xcVn8L7ljtHz21Uv59YQze3xw8hTmCrkOWTR38x-uvtgqqeElafRjwhaAc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-XsNmhMJ-VW-ewOJrRLM7Z1kY1FjIRRyBSvzfgPBcwOA&oe=6A3BE85A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: